            "review_text": "NTThang N\nSingapore, Singapore174 contributions\n0\nCentral location\nJul 2018 • Friends\nThe place locates on a central street of Dong Hoi and are quite spacious. We were there in the a summer evening of World Cup 2018. There was a large screen prepared for a quarterfinal game. With dark lights, the place looked like a bamboo cave. We asked the staffs to recommend us a special drink of the place and they offered Coco smoothie. However, this drink was not so impressive with just coconut and milk. We also ordered another drink so-called Snow Lemon and it tasted much better.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 8, 2018",
